00:11:44,600 --> 00:11:46,080
perfectly good Nash equilibrium.

289
00:11:46,080 --> 00:11:47,800
They still fit the definition.

290
00:11:47,800 --> 00:11:50,800
Nash equilibria.

291
00:11:50,800 --> 00:11:52,880
But sub-game perfect Nash equilibria

292
00:11:52,880 --> 00:11:56,040
are Nash equilibria with an extra property,

