312
00:12:42,600 --> 00:12:45,440
and then there's a new firm, the entry, the entrant.

313
00:12:45,440 --> 00:12:49,200
All right, now the entrant can either go in or out.

314
00:12:49,200 --> 00:12:52,120
And of course, if the entrant goes out,

