01:27:54,980 --> 01:27:58,980
So even in finally repeated games, the set of Nash Equilibrium expands and you may, if

200
01:27:58,980 --> 01:28:01,980
you've ever had a game theory class before at an undergraduate level, it's likely that

201
01:28:01,980 --> 01:28:05,980
you actually heard that finite repetition doesn't matter and only infinite repetition matters.

