218
01:28:35,980 --> 01:28:37,980
And here is the classic proof.

219
01:28:37,980 --> 01:28:41,980
Imagine we play the prisoner's lemma a hundred times in a row.

220
01:28:41,980 --> 01:28:43,980
Two people, we know who we are.

