223
01:28:45,980 --> 01:28:48,980
I know whether you betrayed me or not.

224
01:28:48,980 --> 01:28:49,980
All right.

225
01:28:49,980 --> 01:28:52,980
And the question is, is it possible to stay in cooperation by threatening retaliation,

226
01:28:52,980 --> 01:28:56,980
